{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 46, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was an unforgettable experience. From the moment I arrived, I was struck by the unique blend of traditional and modern culture. I spent my days exploring bustling cities like Tokyo and Kyoto, marveling at ancient temples and shrines, and sampling delicious local cuisine.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market in Tokyo, where I watched in awe as fishermen auctioned off massive tuna and other seafood. I also had the opportunity to try some of the freshest sushi I've ever had, which was a truly unforgettable experience.\n\nIn Kyoto, I visited the iconic Fushimi Inari shrine, famous for its thousands of vermillion torii gates that form a tunnel up the mountain. The hike to the top was challenging, but the stunning views of the city and surrounding countryside made it well worth the effort.\n\nThroughout my trip, I was struck by the kindness and hospitality of the Japanese people, who were always eager to help and share their culture with me. From trying local specialties like ramen and tempura to learning about the history and customs of the country, my trip to Japan was a truly immersive and enriching experience. Overall, I would highly recommend a trip to Japan to anyone looking for a unique and unforgettable adventure.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.05150938406586647}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.10039787739515305}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -1.0728830375228426e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " was", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " an", "logprob": -0.38687756657600403}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.0013146100100129843}, {"token": " experience", "logprob": -0.00015937011630740017}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.00015960850578267127}, {"token": " From", "logprob": -0.00031406714697368443}, {"token": " 